            "review_title": "Review at Capella Hotel",
            "review_text": "Neelo A\nDili53 contributions\n0\nThe Hudson Rooms - Capella Hotel, Hanoi Vietnam\nJul 2026 • Couples\nWe had dinner at Hudson Rooms on the roof top. The food was delicious and the staff most attentive. I was suffering from a cough so the waitstaff, without being asked, offered me warm water and a blanket as it was cold. Which was much appreciated. Pity I don't remember the name of the staff but all of them were very service orientated. Highly recommend Hudson Restaurant.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nWe had steak so highly recommend it.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 22, 2026",
