            "review_title": "Review at Capella Hotel",
            "review_text": "jessicafranks\nCambridge, Massachusetts17 contributions\n0\nAmazing hotel\nOct 2025 • Couples\nThe Capella Hotel in Hanoi is gorgeous and wonderfully located in the old quarter in the city. The hotel is stunning, and at only two years old it is still in immaculate condition. The staff are wonderful, attentive, helpful and kind. Breakfast every morning is a feast and everything we had was so delicious. I also had the best egg coffee of the trip at this hotel! There is free drinks and canapes with live jazz every night which was so fun. My husband and I loved our few days here. Would definitely recommend if you want a luxurious stay while visiting Hanoi.\nRead more\nWritten November 3, 2025",
