            "review_text": "Thomas M\nLafayette, California5 contributions\n0\nThe Capella Hotel , Hanoi, Vietnam!\nJan 2024 • Friends\nBill Bensley architect and Team have created such a beautiful hotel in the French Quarter in Hanoi with stylish furniture and wonderful art work of the walls, floors, ceilings, elevators all accentuated with dramatic lighting. The swimming pool and massage/ spa areas are all very dramatically designed as well. Food and service were all outstanding. 4 wonderful days/nights there. Hotel is only 2 yrs old.\nTop Floor dining available as well.\nRead more\nWritten February 5, 2024",
